    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66732" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακόνδῠλοι</span></b> , οἱ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the last phalanges
				(including knuckles) of the fingers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				84
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the first knuckles and phalanges</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fasc.</u>
				51
			</span></i> (sg.): pl., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μεταξὺ τῶν κονδύλων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—neut. pl. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακομ-κόνδῠλα</span></b> , τά, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.145
			</span></i>.</div>
